title: 策略模式与路线选择
tags: 竞技场咏唱证明系统 AI生成

!! 策略模式在咏唱中的作用

策略模式用于根据技能参数和环境条件选择咏唱路线。不同的路线需要调用不同族的API，产生不同的签名序列。

!! 核心接口

```ts
export interface ChantRouteStrategy {
  choose(params: ChantParams, rules: ChantRuleSet): ChantRoute;
}

export interface ChantRoute {
  id: string;
  seed: ChantSeed;
  depth: number;
  requiredPulseFamily: PowerSourceKind;
  requiredFamilies: ChantApiFamily[];
  score: number;
}
```

!! 具体策略实现

根据距离选择路线：

```ts
export class DistanceRouteStrategy implements ChantRouteStrategy {
  choose(params: ChantParams, rules: ChantRuleSet): ChantRoute {
    const depth = params.distance > 20 ? 5 : 3;
    const requiredFamilies: ChantApiFamily[] = ['archive', 'index', 'hexstone'];

    if (params.distance > 32) {
      requiredFamilies.push('lattice');
    }

    return {
      id: `distance-${depth}`,
      seed: ChantSeed.from(params.distance, params.targetTags),
      depth,
      requiredPulseFamily: params.preferredSource,
      requiredFamilies,
      score: depth * 10 - params.riskBudget,
    };
  }
}
```

根据紧急程度选择：

```ts
export class UrgencyRouteStrategy implements ChantRouteStrategy {
  choose(params: ChantParams, rules: ChantRuleSet): ChantRoute {
    if (params.urgency === 'high') {
      return {
        id: 'urgent-burst',
        seed: ChantSeed.from(params),
        depth: 3,
        requiredPulseFamily: 'hexstonePower',
        requiredFamilies: ['hexstone', 'prayer'],
        score: 25,
      };
    }

    return {
      id: 'standard',
      seed: ChantSeed.from(params),
      depth: 4,
      requiredPulseFamily: 'internalPower',
      requiredFamilies: ['archive', 'index', 'hexstone'],
      score: 15,
    };
  }
}
```

!! 组合策略

```ts
export class CompositeRouteStrategy implements ChantRouteStrategy {
  constructor(private strategies: ChantRouteStrategy[]) {}

  choose(params: ChantParams, rules: ChantRuleSet): ChantRoute {
    const candidates = this.strategies.map(s => s.choose(params, rules));

    return candidates
      .filter(route =>
        route.requiredFamilies.every(f => rules.enabledFamilies.includes(f))
      )
      .sort((a, b) => b.score - a.score)[0];
  }
}
```

!! 与技能触发的关系

策略模式选择的路由直接影响签名链中`pipeline`和`observer`水印的分布。不同的路线会匹配魔法书中不同的技能触发配方。

例如选择`hexstonePower`路线更容易匹配需要蜂解石供能的闪现增强配方。

